{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2025/09/22.html#a185659","date":1758567419000,"content":"I’ve been writing about the rebirth of WordPress in <a href=\"https://iconick.io/cool-kids/\">similar terms</a>, <a href=\"https://daytona.scripting.com/search?q=wordpress\">on my blog</a>, in <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=site%3Ashownotes.scripting.com+wordpress&amp;rlz=1C5CHFA_enUS743US747&amp;oq=site%3Ashownotes.scripting.com+wordpress\">podcasts</a>, hoping people would listen. WordPress is a lot more than people think. We can have <a href=\"https://iconick.io/cool-kids/\">all this</a>, a lot sooner than you think.","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"9cc88b7c56110354e7c32d2406bd021921686c85263320267c939251088c8c23","category":"Sites"}